      "statement": "Package migration is explicit and atomic: a MigrationPlan is submitted to HLA-VALIDATE and either applies atomically or leaves the previous composition pin fully intact with no mixed composition state; HLA-PACKAGE owns migration planning only and never appends Campaign Reality Events directly.",
